OL,6,     FThe latest news from around the UK
OL,7,     Fand around the world.
OL,8,G1300 Haroon Rashid
OL,9,     FHaroon's dropping the week's
OL,10,     Fbiggest tunes along with plenty of
OL,11,     Flaughter and chat. Wherever you're
OL,12,     Flistening, Haroon's got the tunes
OL,13,     Fto keep you company.
OL,14,G1400 Asian Network Certified...
OL,15,     F...Throwbacks with Haroon Rashid.
OL,16,     FHaroon Rashid plays big anthems
OL,17,     Fand tunes you haven't heard in
OL,18,     Fages! From Bollywood, Bhangra,
OL,19,     Fhip-hop, R&B, UK garage and
OL,20,     FBritish Asian beats all mashed up!
