OL,5,G0000 All Star Anthems
OL,6,     FAJD brings All Star Anthems - 30
OL,7,     Fminutes of nonstop club energy,
OL,8,     Fblending house, dance and global
OL,9,     Fsounds into one relentless mix.
OL,10,     FIt's all about big drops and major
OL,11,     Fenergy.
OL,12,G0030 All Star Anthems
OL,13,     FThe All Star Anthems mix delivers
OL,14,     F30 minutes of pure energy as AJ
OL,15,     Fpacks in 24 tracks, seamlessly
OL,16,     Fmixing and blending sounds from
OL,17,     FDrake, Oxlade, Beyonce and Bally
OL,18,     FJagpal.
OL,19,G0100 All Star DJ Takeover: Ajay Music
OL,20,     FAjay Music brings the fire in the
OL,21,     FAll Star DJ Takeover with a R&B x
OL,22,     FSouth Asian themed set.
